# AI Government Scheme Navigator - Implementation Plan

## Overview
Production-grade Agentic RAG platform for navigating 4000-5000 Indian government schemes. Serves millions of users with eligibility recommendations, document processing, and multilingual conversational AI.

## Project Structure
```
HACKATHON_MICROSOFT/
├── gov-scheme-navigator/
│   ├── backend/                # FastAPI + LangGraph
│   │   ├── app/
│   │   │   ├── agents/         # 15 LangGraph agents
│   │   │   ├── api/            # FastAPI routes
│   │   │   ├── core/           # Config, security, middleware
│   │   │   ├── db/             # PostgreSQL + pgVector models
│   │   │   ├── eligibility/    # Rule engine (JSONLogic)
│   │   │   ├── graph/          # Neo4j knowledge graph
│   │   │   ├── mcp/            # MCP servers
│   │   │   ├── rag/            # Retrieval pipeline
│   │   │   ├── scraping/       # Scrapy + Playwright
│   │   │   ├── document_intel/ # OCR + doc processing
│   │   │   └── tools/          # Agent tools
│   │   ├── tests/
│   │   ├── alembic/            # DB migrations
│   │   └── pyproject.toml
│   ├── frontend/               # React/Next.js chat UI
│   ├── docker-compose.yml
│   ├── k8s/                    # Kubernetes manifests
│   └── docs/                   # Architecture docs
```

## Technology Decisions

| Component | Choice | Rationale |
|-----------|--------|-----------|
| API Framework | FastAPI | Async, OpenAPI, production-proven |
| Agent Orchestration | LangGraph | State machines, checkpointing, human-in-loop |
| Vector DB | PostgreSQL + pgVector | Single DB for relational + vector, HNSW indexing |
| Knowledge Graph | Neo4j | Best graph DB, Cypher query language |
| Cache | Redis | Session, profile, query caching |
| Queue | Redis Streams (MVP) → Kafka (V2) | Start simple, scale later |
| Embedding | `sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2` | Multilingual, Indian language support |
| Reranker | `cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2` | Fast, accurate reranking |
| LLM | Gemini 1.5 Pro (primary), GPT-4o (fallback) | Cost-effective, large context |
| OCR | Tesseract + Azure Document Intelligence | Free tier + production accuracy |
| Scraping | Scrapy + Playwright | Static + dynamic page support |
| Rule Engine | `json-logic-py` | Deterministic eligibility, auditable |

