## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `pytest backend/tests/` - Unit tests for all components
- `pytest backend/tests/test_eligibility.py` - Rule engine accuracy tests
- `pytest backend/tests/test_retrieval.py` - RAG retrieval quality tests

### Manual Verification
- Run `docker-compose up` and verify all services start
- Test chat endpoint with sample eligibility queries
- Verify scheme data ingestion from MyScheme portal
- Test document upload and OCR extraction
